  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fritto misto di mare uses "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dredging",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dredging"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " rather than batter: the seafood is dried thoroughly, tossed in a mix of flour and cornflour, then fried in very hot oil for just 2 to 3 minutes. The result is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fritto misto",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fritto-misto"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with a shattering crisp shell and tender seafood inside. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The key is oil at the correct temperature and dry seafood. Any moisture will cause steaming and a soggy coating. Pat everything very dry and fry in small batches."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "squid",
              "amount": 300,
              "unit": "g",
              "prepNote": "cleaned, bodies cut into rings and tentacles separated",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
